  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Callbacks post messages",
      "items": [
        "The native 1/0 value maps to Enabled(true/false). The callback does not call App::update.",
        "A full queue drops its oldest message and increments dropped; buffering is bounded.",
        "Programmatic value changes are suppressed during view writes so the app does not enqueue its own update."
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Describe the view after the batch",
      "items": [
        "Ui::drain processes its message budget, then reconciles once. An idle, clean UI skips that work.",
        "This is the message path. The platform timer loop also advances LVGL drawing and animation."
      ]
    }
  ]
